Subject: [PATCH 1625/3799] soh: rename func_80AD58D4 -> EnPoField_SoulHover

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: bobs the soul on a sine, offers the interaction while the player is touching it, and lets it laugh and fade away when its lifetime runs out.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Po_Field/z_en_po_field.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Po_Field/z_en_po_field.c | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Po_Field/z_en_po_field.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Po_Field/z_en_po_field.c
index f5a8176bb..84c0b563a 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Po_Field/z_en_po_field.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Po_Field/z_en_po_field.c
@@ -36,7 +36,8 @@ void EnPoField_Disappear(EnPoField* this, PlayState* play);
 void EnPoField_SoulIdle(EnPoField* this, PlayState* play);
 // LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80AD587C: drifts the soul upward while fading its light in, then hands off to the hovering state.
 void EnPoField_SoulAppear(EnPoField* this, PlayState* play);  // was func_80AD587C [LLM:HIGH]
-void func_80AD58D4(EnPoField* this, PlayState* play);
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80AD58D4: bobs the soul on a sine, offers the interaction while the player is touching it, and lets it laugh and fade away when its lifetime runs out.
+void EnPoField_SoulHover(EnPoField* this, PlayState* play);  // was func_80AD58D4 [LLM:HIGH]
 void EnPoField_SoulDisappear(EnPoField* this, PlayState* play);
 void EnPoField_SoulInteract(EnPoField* this, PlayState* play);
 void EnPoField_SpawnFlame(EnPoField* this);
@@ -367,7 +368,7 @@ void EnPoField_SetupSoulHover(EnPoField* this) {
     this->actionTimer = 400;
     this->unk_194 = 32;
     this->actor.flags |= ACTOR_FLAG_ATTENTION_ENABLED;
-    this->actionFunc = func_80AD58D4;
+    this->actionFunc = EnPoField_SoulHover;  // was func_80AD58D4 [LLM:HIGH]
 }
 
 void EnPoField_SetupSoulDisappear(EnPoField* this) {
@@ -668,7 +669,7 @@ void EnPoField_SoulAppear(EnPoField* this, PlayState* play) {
     }
 }
 
-void func_80AD58D4(EnPoField* this, PlayState* play) {
+void EnPoField_SoulHover(EnPoField* this, PlayState* play) {
     if (this->actionTimer != 0) {
         this->actionTimer--;
     }
